            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>Live History – “In Time” performance</h3>
<p>Date: Saturday, September 26 and Saturday, October 3<br>Time: 10 am to 4 pm (recommended final entry by 3 pm)<br>Fee: $16.75 plus tax<br>Ages 14 and up<br><a href="https://anc.ca.apm.activecommunities.com/ottawa/activity/search?locale=en-US&amp;activity_select_param=2&amp;drop_in=0&amp;activity_keyword=Live%20History&amp;viewMode=list"><strong>Advance registration is required</strong></a>.&nbsp;</p>
<p>We’ve teamed up with <a href="https://www.livehistoryshows.com/">Live History</a> to offer a unique experience that will transport you back in time to the era of the March Township gentry. Explore one of Ottawa’s most unique historic houses, engage with character actors, follow their clues and put your puzzle-solving skills to the test before the clock runs out. “In Time” offers a heritage-inspired spin on escape rooms, scavenger hunts, and live theatre. “In Time” takes approximately 60 minutes to complete. Start the experience at any time during show hours (10 am to 4 pm); we recommend arriving no later than 3 pm. Bonus! Pack a picnic and enjoy the beautiful park grounds overlooking the Ottawa River.</p>
