            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Pinhey’s Point Historic Site features a 19<sup>th</sup>&nbsp;century manor house and stone ruins, 88 acres of greenspace, and stunning views of the Ottawa River. The grounds immediately surrounding the house are available for use by rental clients.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Use the&nbsp;<a href="https://ottawa.ca/en/recreation-and-parks/facilities/facility-rentals">rental search tool</a>&nbsp;to find an event space that meets your needs.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a href="https://ottawa.ca/en/recreation-and-parks/facilities/facility-rentals/grounds-pinheys-point-historic-site">Grounds - Pinhey’s Point Historic Site</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>For more information, please contact our Customer Service Booking Clerk. Call <strong>613-580-9638</strong> or email <a href="mailto:museums@ottawa.ca">museums@ottawa.ca</a>.</p></div>
      
